namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Animated::setSize(Offset value)
\brief Set logical width and height immediately.

Cancels scheduled size changes and preserves separately configured growth rates. Does not change transform scale. This is an immediate, chainable operation. It throws after wait() or andThen(); only operations with a duration can be part of a timed animation sequence.

\param value Logical size value.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see getSize(), resizeTo(), setStretching()
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Animated::setSize(number width, number height)
\brief Set logical width and height immediately.

Cancels scheduled size changes and preserves separately configured growth rates. Does not change transform scale. This is an immediate, chainable operation. It throws after wait() or andThen(); only operations with a duration can be part of a timed animation sequence.

\param width Logical size value.
\param height Logical size value.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see getSize(), resizeTo(), setStretching()
*/
 }
